When you choose an at-home teeth bleaching[ kit], it’s your responsibility to[ follow] the instructions on the package. Don’t leave the gel or strips on your teeth longer than advised or you could experience tooth sensitivity and[ sore] gums. Also, avoid drinking soda, sports drinks or other sugary/acidic beverages for several hours after whit[ening] to prevent etching your teeth.
