Johnson and[ Bold]in are known for being[ precise], tactical receivers. But Butler says the most[ valuable lesson] of working with them has been learning about how they think.
Butler admitted the first time he worked with Johnson, who went to six Pro Bowls with the Detroit Lions from 2010-15, that he was a little starstruck.
